  "claim": "The American attorney, law professor and former member of the Texas House of Representatives who was portrayed by the actress known for \"Love Child\" (1982), \"Places in the Heart\" (1984), \"Field of Dreams\" (1989) etc., is best known for the Roe v. Wade U. S. Supreme Court case.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Sarah Weddington. Sentence: Sarah Ragle Weddington (born February 5, 1945), is an American attorney, law professor and former member of the Texas House of Representatives best known for representing \"Jane Roe\" (real name Norma McCorvey) in the landmark \"Roe v. Wade\" case before the United States Supreme Court.\nPage: Amy Madigan. Sentence: Her other film credits include \"Love Child\" (1982), \"Places in the Heart\" (1984), \"Field of Dreams\" (1989), \"Uncle Buck\" (1989), \"The Dark Half\" (1993), \"Pollock\" (2000), and \"Gone Baby Gone\" (2007).",
