        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Weddington, Amy Madigan\n- Works: Love Child, Places in the Heart, Field of Dreams, Roe v. Wade\n- Roles: attorney, law professor, Texas House of Representatives member, actress\n\nFacts:\n- Sarah Weddington was an American attorney, law professor, and former member of the Texas House of Representatives.\n- Sarah Weddington was best known for the U.S. Supreme Court case Roe v. Wade.\n- Amy Madigan is an actress known for Love Child (1982), Places in the Heart (1984), and Field of Dreams (1989).\n- Amy Madigan portrayed Sarah Weddington.",
