        "original_id": "2aeaf704-62de-5d0f-800b-c5ab85ba7207",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sarah Weddington, Norma McCorvey, Amy Madigan\n- Roles: attorney, law professor, Texas House of Representatives member, actress\n- Events: Roe v. Wade\n- Works: Love Child, Places in the Heart, Field of Dreams, Uncle Buck, The Dark Half, Pollock, Gone Baby Gone\n\nFacts:\n- Sarah Ragle Weddington was born on February 5, 1945.\n- Sarah Weddington is an American attorney, law professor, and former member of the Texas House of Representatives.\n- Sarah Weddington is best known for representing Jane Roe, whose real name was Norma McCorvey, in the landmark Roe v. Wade case before the United States Supreme Court.\n- Amy Madigan appeared in the film Love Child in 1982.\n- Amy Madigan appeared in the film Places in the Heart in 1984.\n- Amy Madigan appeared in the films Field of Dreams and Uncle Buck in 1989.\n- Amy Madigan appeared in the film The Dark Half in 1993.\n- Amy Madigan appeared in the film Pollock in 2000.\n- Amy Madigan appeared in the film Gone Baby Gone in 2007.",
